      "writtenOn": "2018-07-09T20:54:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This feels like validation that should be done in the controller layer. If we detect we\u0027re looking for a project hierarchy in the controller layer, we can introduce a specific list_limits_for_project_hierarchy() method to address that case (which should keep this method simpler).",
